{
  "$schema": "folio-block-summaries/v1",
  "entry": "10665-44867",
  "summaries": [
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-000",
      "source": "sections/sec-000-wha645-preparación-para-una-gripe-pandémica-inte.md",
      "source_hash": "946067056be9e576f5108150d753ed765a8cf17e6223088301f932b9b431729b",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The body of resolution WHA64.5, which welcomes the working group's outcome and adopts the Pandemic Influenza Preparedness Framework. It sets out requests to Member States, stakeholders and the Director-General, including reporting on progress, adopted on 24 May 2011.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-001",
      "source": "sections/sec-001-1-principios.md",
      "source_hash": "b0f9df5d8846ae32d7ecb6aa515280fb0c22c39a7bbe03885d42fd24ba704c22",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out the principles of the Pandemic Influenza Preparedness Framework, in which WHO Member States recall earlier resolutions and note the ongoing risk of an influenza pandemic. They affirm the importance of rapid, systematic sharing of viruses alongside fair and equitable sharing of benefits. They also stress sovereign rights over biological resources and equitable access to quality vaccines, medicines and technologies for developing countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-002",
      "source": "sections/sec-002-2-objetivo.md",
      "source_hash": "9f9eb513c8a7ea22c8584fe6d232fe62c261446e433e6275cd1eb4ea822213ae",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "States the Framework's objective of improving pandemic influenza preparedness and response through a fair, transparent and efficient WHO global influenza surveillance and response system, putting virus sharing and benefit sharing on an equal footing.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-003",
      "source": "sections/sec-003-3-alcance.md",
      "source_hash": "efefd14f485152feecfebb1e3df21eba0287791542ef406282269357feef7803",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines the Framework's scope as covering the sharing of H5N1 and other potentially pandemic human influenza viruses and related benefits, but not seasonal influenza or other pathogens.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-004",
      "source": "sections/sec-004-4-definiciones-y-uso-de-los-términos.md",
      "source_hash": "89cd45819a46b3f90312f6495fc56ab29e8e9ca2b2c0fb824bc9d9fde8e708d2",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Introduces the definitions of terms used in the Framework.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-005",
      "source": "sections/sec-005-41-materiales-biológicos-de-preparación-para-una.md",
      "source_hash": "c0760b8868d050622471894561b23d6a6919e0688f5ab48721a0f14bdc1f3b2c",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines \"PIP biological materials\" as human clinical specimens, virus isolates of wild-type H5N1 and other potentially pandemic influenza viruses, modified viruses and related genetic material covered by the Framework and its transfer agreements.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-006",
      "source": "sections/sec-006-42-otros-términos-técnicos.md",
      "source_hash": "9cc2b29166e84b20ddece221f3076805a384bd8d3f0845a8f78d2d2721d7359d",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines further technical terms used in the Framework, such as genetic sequences, reference reagents and diagnostic reagents. It also defines candidate vaccine viruses and related materials. Wild-type viruses are defined as those grown directly from clinical specimens without deliberate modification.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-007",
      "source": "sections/sec-007-43-instituciones-organizaciones-y-entidades.md",
      "source_hash": "146f126610940d5d5130a53c0f5c759e8d14cdb96ced5ce1ae90fbedaef51972",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines the laboratories in the WHO global influenza surveillance and response system, including Essential Regulatory Laboratories, National Influenza Centres, WHO Collaborating Centres and H5 Reference Laboratories. It also defines other institutions and entities such as vaccine manufacturers.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-008",
      "source": "sections/sec-008-44-otros-términos.md",
      "source_hash": "36275750fafb7c57a1ac2292fb2ef9a9581ee95221ebb3c48df31bd15d8b0cd4",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines other terms used in the Framework, such as the Advisory Group, affected country, Director-General and least developed countries. It ends with the heading of the section on the virus sharing system.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-009",
      "source": "sections/sec-009-potencialmente-pandémicos-para-el-hombre-en-el-c.md",
      "source_hash": "1eff1e86d63e4b2d80bc13293d6453642ca69b1558d3cd4a29973bc3b6f1f488",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Continues a section heading on the system for sharing potentially pandemic influenza viruses in the context of pandemic preparedness.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-010",
      "source": "sections/sec-010-51-consideraciones-generales.md",
      "source_hash": "5099e3bc603df1fb264fc5e0bde769ef3c101b3cf11f97be043892a151fe9e28",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out general provisions for virus sharing, asking Member States, through National Influenza Centres and authorized laboratories, to send PIP biological materials from all human cases of H5N1 and other potentially pandemic viruses to WHO laboratories promptly. It describes the consent and conditions for onward transfer under the Framework.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-011",
      "source": "sections/sec-011-52-datos-sobre-secuencias-genéticas.md",
      "source_hash": "a8e8ee9141b375ae0ab3b9cc3118841f12b9ed5aaba10e90bdf0c319068b9c18",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Provides that genetic sequence data on H5N1 and other potentially pandemic viruses should be shared rapidly with the originating laboratory and among WHO surveillance laboratories. It encourages greater transparency in making such data available.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-012",
      "source": "sections/sec-012-53-mecanismos-de-trazabilidad-y-notificación.md",
      "source_hash": "cf715e9869ae74ca2e6e3a91f6ed90fb876e15e45a611f877054e1fff51be3ab",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out a transparent, electronic traceability mechanism to track movements of PIP biological materials within and outside the WHO system in real time. It also covers notifying originating countries and laboratories, including of any changes to transfer conditions.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-013",
      "source": "sections/sec-013-54-acuerdos-modelo-de-transferencia-de-material.md",
      "source_hash": "ca43201d7d772b0b3da263fda4e7e75e8f11ae321a4573bf5098e7205983c901",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "States that Standard Material Transfer Agreement 1 governs transfers within the WHO surveillance system and that the Director-General will conclude Agreement 2 with entities outside it, before introducing the benefit-sharing system.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-014",
      "source": "sections/sec-014-60-consideraciones-generales.md",
      "source_hash": "dbfa5270be755cae4f039865e69043497814b13d68827b91098053e9018f065c",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out general considerations for the benefit-sharing system, asking Member States to work with WHO and urging manufacturers and researchers to contribute. Benefits are to be prioritized according to public health risk and need, especially for developing countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-015",
      "source": "sections/sec-015-6-sistema-de-compartición-de-beneficios-en-el-co.md",
      "source_hash": "5f5e815d18eea59e698a7bbecd5c010f2b010c83409d1e78761f0f1675aae7c1",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "States that the benefit-sharing system comprises the elements described in the rest of this part.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-016",
      "source": "sections/sec-016-61-coordinación-de-la-preparación-y-respuesta-an.md",
      "source_hash": "2c25fea8ea9b17f224f7d7b4bfff08c339695e6b3901894d756b22c9456733d9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Provides that WHO will coordinate pandemic preparedness and response in line with the International Health Regulations (2005) and the Framework, preparing with Member States during inter-pandemic periods.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-017",
      "source": "sections/sec-017-62-evaluación-del-riesgo-de-pandemia-y-respuesta.md",
      "source_hash": "93f0d77ef0c99c2fdda6ed119c02bcb8c3c524442fef50b23808c7e22a1887e9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Provides for WHO laboratories to share summary laboratory analyses and information on PIP materials with the WHO Secretariat and originating Member States to support pandemic risk assessment. It also covers help for countries in building surveillance and response capacity, including training.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-018",
      "source": "sections/sec-018-63-suministro-de-virus-candidatos-para-vacunas-p.md",
      "source_hash": "8fb6fb044b60ae868f71f7f60e3866f463c48532e41bbdfa97d0d9dce28d0e5e",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Requires WHO laboratories to supply candidate vaccine viruses on request to influenza vaccine manufacturers and Member State laboratories on non-preferential terms, observing biosafety requirements.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-019",
      "source": "sections/sec-019-64-suministro-de-reactivos-de-diagnóstico-y-kits.md",
      "source_hash": "5b831bea74c72809c148f52a6af8437514a2f248bb81f9ff2fd417abe257500b",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Provides for WHO laboratories to supply non-commercial diagnostic reagents and test kits free of charge to National Influenza Centres and authorized laboratories, with wider supply if circumstances justify it.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-020",
      "source": "sections/sec-020-65-suministro-de-reactivos-de-referencia-para-de.md",
      "source_hash": "afaadd0b3ebba699e0e07926c0f5ea0131e9c0190906ecc0135195e289dd9d45",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits Essential Regulatory Laboratories to supply reference reagents for testing the potency of H5N1 and other pandemic vaccines to national regulators and manufacturers in all Member States.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-021",
      "source": "sections/sec-021-66-creación-de-capacidad-de-laboratorio-y-de-vig.md",
      "source_hash": "931b8eeefa23b25542d210dbffbe8e421d217716bf21ccfdb2b2ad98c0305ca9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Urges Member States with advanced capacity to help other countries, especially developing ones, build influenza laboratory and surveillance capacity, including early detection and characterization of viruses.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-022",
      "source": "sections/sec-022-67-fortalecimiento-de-la-capacidad-de-reglamenta.md",
      "source_hash": "05c8040a4101e829a58d360de9ccb0810ab5706aca2b9baf4992316d87495384",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Calls on Member States with advanced regulatory capacity to help strengthen regulators in developing countries so that pandemic vaccines, diagnostics and medicines can be approved rapidly.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-023",
      "source": "sections/sec-023-68-reservas-de-antivirales.md",
      "source_hash": "5fcf8d2ecc62fda6c7dd8de2e6b2f5d8547d2af8086d0bfce635a3e60364013f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits the Director-General to seek contributions for WHO stockpiles of antiviral medicines from multilateral bodies, donors, foundations and manufacturers. Expert guidance is to set their size, composition, replenishment and deployment.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-024",
      "source": "sections/sec-024-69-reserva-de-vacunas-en-preparación-para-una-gr.md",
      "source_hash": "3d05fe40bf5af3aab0b9f87aec103aa495c8b5ef9f1ec6801de94689aecf8ef3",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits the Director-General to establish a WHO stockpile of H5N1 and other potentially pandemic vaccines with related equipment, initially 150 million doses, used on expert advice. It covers deployment plans developed with experts and Member States.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-025",
      "source": "sections/sec-025-610-acceso-a-las-vacunas-para-su-utilización-por.md",
      "source_hash": "793ba4768b370e3823fbdd982cd0bee0565dca6ff13764114de4eff9541d6568",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Calls on Member States to urge manufacturers to set aside part of each production run of potentially pandemic vaccines for developing countries during inter-pandemic periods. These supplies should be available at the same time as for developed countries and at tiered prices.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-026",
      "source": "sections/sec-026-611-acceso-a-vacunas-contra-la-gripe-pandémica.md",
      "source_hash": "5e718181c2c29afc4949a562c3bf3a1d531f49c647e438950ce080bdbb6a9975",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Calls for manufacturers to set aside part of each pandemic vaccine production run for developing countries, and for an expert group to develop international mechanisms for fair distribution during a pandemic.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-027",
      "source": "sections/sec-027-612-fijación-de-precios-de-distinto-nivel.md",
      "source_hash": "94cf4b2d6d2f49cfd6371409fa80502cd7f74bc87621af4161c6042a4e3ef31e",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Urges influenza vaccine and antiviral manufacturers to apply tiered pricing so that developing countries can afford pandemic vaccines and antivirals, taking account of the vulnerability of least developed countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-028",
      "source": "sections/sec-028-613-transferencia-de-tecnología.md",
      "source_hash": "77d8d2183b2f653e1eea300b87401e4e2f4a5d3b70bbed9e0787c2c827da32e1",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits the Director-General to work with Member States and manufacturers on the Global Action Plan for Influenza Vaccines, including new production plants and technology transfer to developing countries. It also encourages seasonal influenza vaccination programmes to sustain manufacturing capacity.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-029",
      "source": "sections/sec-029-614-mecanismos-de-financiación-sostenibles-e-inn.md",
      "source_hash": "2946a7846ddb633e4663aa0702432dc6f08bd5faf3112bd9abc3c4de654a4cdd",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out sustainable and innovative financing for the benefit-sharing system, including an annual partnership contribution from influenza vaccine, diagnostic and pharmaceutical manufacturers using the WHO system. It explains how the contribution is set relative to the system's running costs, around half of them. It describes how the funds will be used for pandemic preparedness and response.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-030",
      "source": "sections/sec-030-7-gobernanza-y-examen.md",
      "source_hash": "96545e0eae99a599ab8e327998a64d42e46fa38706afc50956fa9853e95a1e93",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "A section heading for governance and review of the Framework.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-031",
      "source": "sections/sec-031-71-consideraciones-generales.md",
      "source_hash": "18a55d1a56b9adee2016c4c4862d1e2d3a9a98a2edca4b276cf40b4b76e53721",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Provides that the World Health Assembly oversees implementation of the Framework with advice from the Director-General. The oversight mechanism includes an independent Advisory Group with regional and expert representation.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-032",
      "source": "sections/sec-032-72-grupo-asesor.md",
      "source_hash": "5b399440b917e08f19c446696d821515d7051185f2f120d026e3b812f51d1708",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes the Advisory Group's role in monitoring the Framework and giving evidence-based advice to the Director-General without performing administrative functions. It also covers the group's membership, reporting and review of its mandate by the Health Assembly.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-033",
      "source": "sections/sec-033-73-gobernanza-y-examen-del-mandato-de-los-labora.md",
      "source_hash": "c3b32b65c444cfb7728b07505f7d474041319a849adea114f4678a923cbb585b",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out how terms of reference for WHO influenza laboratories are developed under the Framework's guiding principles and reviewed with the Advisory Group. It covers monitoring of compliance, with possible suspension or withdrawal of WHO designation for serious breaches.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-034",
      "source": "sections/sec-034-74-vigilancia-y-examen-del-marco.md",
      "source_hash": "5224d05fcaebb80bca0eb69588e58f2cae74a2820bfcfc76089435bf6dd4acac",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Requires the Director-General to report every two years to the Health Assembly on laboratory and surveillance capacity, vaccine production capacity, transfer agreements and benefit sharing. The Framework is to be reviewed in 2016 with proposed revisions in 2017.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-035",
      "source": "sections/sec-035-anexos.md",
      "source_hash": "c7e511f2fda9a287b0bf3466902f341da6509a7974226d0400858efe2c028979",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Contains the annexes of the Framework, starting with Standard Material Transfer Agreement 1 for transfers of PIP biological materials within the WHO global influenza surveillance and response system. It sets out the terms binding providers and recipients, followed by Standard Material Transfer Agreement 2 for recipients outside the system, with their benefit-sharing commitments. Further annexes give the Advisory Group's terms of reference and its procedures. The block ends with the heading of Annex 4 on guiding principles for terms of reference of the system's laboratories.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-036",
      "source": "sections/sec-036-de-vigilancia-y-respuesta-a-la-gripe-smvrg-para.md",
      "source_hash": "ca8fea172f082b0b7130d4332b748c49c2be6c4e661f9004d2ec06d111bcd862",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out guiding principles for the terms of reference of laboratories in the WHO influenza surveillance system, noting that roles differ between National Influenza Centres, Collaborating Centres, H5 Reference Laboratories and Essential Regulatory Laboratories but share common functions. It ends with the heading of Annex 5.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-037",
      "source": "sections/sec-037-anexo-5-mandato-relativo-al-trabajo-con-material.md",
      "source_hash": "5ce42b0730584393bbfbbea5e43b9bf6d21e1f0be5111b756441c47042d26232",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Annex 5 gives terms of reference for laboratories working with PIP biological materials, starting with background on the WHO global influenza surveillance and response system as an alert mechanism for viruses of pandemic potential. It covers the four categories of laboratories in turn, beginning with WHO Collaborating Centres on influenza. It sets out their duties on virus receipt, characterization, sharing, publication and acknowledgement of originating laboratories. It closes with the ISBN and WHO's address.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44867/blocks/prose-sec-front-matter",
      "source": "sections/sec-front-matter.md",
      "source_hash": "1fde2f35376ec943aecd551cf3a9e7bc300ce5c8d43dc0c867014fe03a30dbf7",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The front matter of the Spanish edition of WHO's Pandemic Influenza Preparedness Framework for the sharing of influenza viruses and access to vaccines and other benefits. It contains the title pages, cataloguing and copyright details and a table of contents. It ends with the opening of World Health Assembly resolution WHA64.5, which considered the report of the Member States' working group.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
